<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10852" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνυπέρ-βᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>impassable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρημνοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					64.21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not to be overcome, unsurpassable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				9.153
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀηδία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Vit.</u>
					p.12J.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>nottransgressing the bounds,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάθεσις ἀ. τῶν κατ᾽ ὀρθὸν λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					7.93
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>
			<i>without omission,</i> of numerical progression, <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Ar.</u>
				2.23
			</span></i>; <i>unfailingly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.544
			</span></i>.</div>
